      "comment": "ASTON EXCESS (7) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth (23.11) in a Grade 5 at Geelong. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and three minor placings to his credit. Has ability and is a key runner. FREDDY DEEDS (1) doesn't win out of turn. Finished third (22.58) at this track latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Expected to feature. SAINT JADE (8) drifted back settling but did best work late to finish 4th at this track over 390m (22.78). Key runner who gets her chance to atone. SAINT FINNIE (5) can fill a top-three spot.",
